## Why this rule exists

2026-07-14: in the sibling repo `multi-pair-trading-agent`, a production
reliability fix was delegated without a target-branch pin and landed on the
wrong branch (`next-gen` instead of the `main` the user had declared for
that session). This repo carries the same class of risk on
`main` ↔ `multi-agent-ensemble`, and the same delegation discipline
applies here.
